          "Massive built-in audience actively searching for templates",
          "SEO-friendly platform with strong discoverability",
          "Established trust and buyer protection",
          "Easy digital download automation"
        ],
        "cons": [
          "High competition",
          "Fee structure eats into margins",
          "Limited branding/customer data"
        ],
        "action_items": [
          "Create Etsy seller account and verify identity",
          "Design branded shop banner (1200x300px)",
          "Write SEO-optimized shop description with keywords",
          "Set up 10 starter listings with optimized titles/tags",
          "Enable Etsy Ads after 30 days ($1-3 daily budget)",
          "Join Etsy template seller communities for tips"
